WEBVTT

00:06.930 --> 00:09.740
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:10.460 --> 00:12.490
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:13.250 --> 00:15.030
<i>Where's Shido?</i>

00:15.030 --> 00:16.930
<i>Where's Mio Takamiya?</i>

00:17.490 --> 00:20.230
<i>Ahh, I'm sleepy...</i>

00:21.150 --> 00:23.050
<i>No, I can't...</i>

00:23.620 --> 00:24.700
<i>I have to...</i>

00:25.720 --> 00:29.190
<i>I have to hurry back to Shido...</i>

00:31.730 --> 00:33.330
Will you sink?

00:33.330 --> 00:35.260
Well, that works too.

00:36.940 --> 00:37.850
Who's there?!

00:38.460 --> 00:39.940
Who are you?!

00:40.470 --> 00:41.390
My name?

00:41.850 --> 00:43.620
I have none.

00:44.690 --> 00:49.770
If I had to say, then I am you.

00:49.770 --> 00:50.930
Me?

00:51.800 --> 00:54.100
What on earth is going on here?

00:54.790 --> 00:56.260
Is this a dream?

00:56.690 --> 00:59.650
That's not correct, 
but it's not far off either.

01:00.390 --> 01:05.660
The only difference is we're inside 
that woman, not your head.

01:05.940 --> 01:07.170
That woman?

01:07.830 --> 01:09.670
You mean Mio Takamiya?

01:10.880 --> 01:12.240
Where's everyone else?!

01:12.240 --> 01:15.420
If I'm here, then shouldn't 
everyone else be here, too?

01:16.430 --> 01:19.010
You're the only one alive in here.

01:19.590 --> 01:25.690
All the others died as humans 
when that woman stole their Sephirah.

01:32.370 --> 01:33.260
Wait.

01:33.260 --> 01:34.690
Died as humans?

01:34.690 --> 01:36.130
What do you mean?

01:36.130 --> 01:39.280
I know Origami and Kotori used to be human,

01:39.280 --> 01:44.700
but Yoshino, Kaguya, Yuzuru, 
and Natsumi are pure spirits like me, right?

01:44.700 --> 01:46.100
No.

01:46.100 --> 01:49.650
Aside from that woman, 
all those known as Spirits

01:49.650 --> 01:53.590
are just humans 
who that woman granted Sephirah.

01:54.090 --> 01:56.940
All of those you named just now

01:56.940 --> 02:00.210
simply lost their memories 
of when they were human.

02:00.210 --> 02:00.970
Wha?!

02:00.970 --> 02:04.420
All the Spirits used to be human?

02:05.110 --> 02:09.170
No, I remember Nia 
saying something like that, too...

02:09.170 --> 02:11.980
But if that is true,

02:12.320 --> 02:14.360
then why am I alive?

02:14.730 --> 02:16.650
If I was a human too,

02:16.650 --> 02:22.190
then I should've died as a human when my 
Sephirah was stolen, just like the others!

02:23.260 --> 02:24.870
I'll tell you.

02:25.870 --> 02:27.110
That's because...

04:03.300 --> 04:07.350
What I've just told you 
is everything I understand.

04:10.580 --> 04:11.340
Hmm?

04:12.270 --> 04:14.540
I thought you would be confused,

04:14.540 --> 04:17.140
but you've absorbed that surprisingly fast.

04:17.140 --> 04:17.830
Yes.

04:18.710 --> 04:21.360
No, I am confused.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.900
But if what you say is true,

04:23.900 --> 04:26.130
then right now I'm grateful for that.

04:26.460 --> 04:27.200
Oh?

04:28.050 --> 04:30.340
I'm still here and alive.

04:30.340 --> 04:33.040
And if I'm alive,

04:33.040 --> 04:34.460
then I can still fight back.

04:34.790 --> 04:36.940
Your enemy is our mother.

04:36.940 --> 04:40.070
Even if you are able to fight, 
you're no match for her.

04:40.070 --> 04:43.340
The most you can do is buy 
a few minutes of time at best.

04:43.830 --> 04:47.730
Then she'll eliminate you without 
leaving a trace of consciousness.

04:48.100 --> 04:49.050
I don't care.

04:49.050 --> 04:53.340
If I buy a few minutes, 
then Shido might be able to escape.

04:53.340 --> 04:57.860
He might be able to think of some way 
to break free of this situation.

04:57.860 --> 05:02.340
That's enough hope to risk my life for.

05:02.860 --> 05:03.940
Oh?

05:04.620 --> 05:07.970
Though if you die,

05:07.970 --> 05:10.690
then that means I will perish as well.

05:11.100 --> 05:13.380
Since I am you.

05:13.380 --> 05:15.450
I-Is that true?

05:15.450 --> 05:17.620
Well, hmm...

05:18.820 --> 05:19.820
Sorry.

05:20.460 --> 05:25.230
But you want me to fight too, don't you?

05:25.230 --> 05:26.300
Oh?

05:26.300 --> 05:27.630
Why do you think that?

05:27.920 --> 05:31.760
Because you called out to me, didn't you?

05:36.170 --> 05:37.350
True!

05:37.990 --> 05:39.990
Yes, that's true.

05:44.500 --> 05:47.010
Then you should go, me.

05:47.410 --> 05:49.500
Go fight to your heart's content.

05:49.930 --> 05:53.130
Yes. Thank you, me.

06:05.100 --> 06:07.660
Everyone's dead?

06:08.430 --> 06:10.270
No way...

06:19.170 --> 06:20.350
Shin...

06:20.680 --> 06:21.650
I'm sorry.

06:22.100 --> 06:26.990
I never wanted to make you sad,

06:27.340 --> 06:29.540
but it'll be all right.

06:30.130 --> 06:32.470
Those memories will be gone soon enough.

06:33.070 --> 06:35.370
This sin is mine to bear alone.

06:35.780 --> 06:39.310
So there's no need to blame yourself, Shin.

06:40.790 --> 06:41.880
I...

06:42.140 --> 06:49.010
We'll redo everything, starting from 
that day you were shot in front of me.

06:49.470 --> 06:51.580
Redo everything?

06:52.290 --> 06:54.250
Forgetting everything?

06:54.640 --> 06:56.040
Yes.

06:56.040 --> 06:58.020
As Shinji Takamiya.

07:08.530 --> 07:11.280
Shido!

07:15.620 --> 07:16.580
Shido!

07:16.580 --> 07:17.410
You're safe?!

07:18.110 --> 07:19.040
Tohka?!

07:21.440 --> 07:23.680
Nothing is over yet!

07:23.680 --> 07:26.540
Now, stand up, Shido!

07:27.470 --> 07:28.350
Tohka!

07:29.140 --> 07:30.300
Tohka!

07:31.030 --> 07:32.310
I'm sorry, Tohka...

07:32.890 --> 07:33.900
I...

07:34.380 --> 07:35.960
For a moment, I nearly gave up...

07:35.960 --> 07:37.290
What are you saying?!

07:37.290 --> 07:40.560
Shido, you're still alive right now 
because you didn't lose hope!

07:41.010 --> 07:43.150
Could there be any better result than that?!

07:45.090 --> 07:47.190
Thank you, Tohka.

07:47.540 --> 07:51.280
Honestly, you keep saving me, Tohka.

07:51.280 --> 07:53.700
I'm always relying on you too, Shido.

07:54.180 --> 07:57.330
Even now, I was able to return because of you.

07:57.330 --> 08:00.700
I'm able to stand before Mio because of you!

08:01.340 --> 08:02.710
Tohka...

08:04.130 --> 08:05.210
Yeah!

08:05.530 --> 08:06.880
I see.

08:06.880 --> 08:09.210
So it was you, Tohka.

08:09.670 --> 08:11.390
Of course it is.

08:11.390 --> 08:14.920
I was always sure that if 
any would stand against me,

08:14.920 --> 08:17.720
then it would be you.

08:19.380 --> 08:22.920
I divided my power into ten Sephirah

08:22.920 --> 08:25.730
and granted them to humans to create Spirits.

08:26.380 --> 08:29.050
Though for some reason,

08:29.050 --> 08:33.290
one of those ten Sephirah 
sprouted its own consciousness.

08:33.940 --> 08:37.580
Almost like the moment I was born, too.

08:38.870 --> 08:42.270
Shin, you've realized it too, haven't you?

08:42.740 --> 08:45.250
The difference between Tohka 
and the other Spirits.

08:45.750 --> 08:50.060
The one thing the other Spirits had 
that Tohka didn't have.

08:52.530 --> 08:53.530
A name.

08:53.530 --> 08:54.260
Yes.

08:55.020 --> 08:58.510
All the Spirits used to be human.

08:59.020 --> 09:01.590
That's why they possessed 
a name from the start.

09:02.600 --> 09:05.370
However, Tohka was different.

09:05.370 --> 09:07.180
Only Tohka and I were.

09:08.010 --> 09:09.410
I had my share of confusion.

09:09.820 --> 09:12.990
I had agonized over my lack of a name, too.

09:13.670 --> 09:17.490
Though right now I'm grateful for that.

09:17.860 --> 09:22.500
I was able to have you grant me my name 
because I didn't have one of my own.

09:23.000 --> 09:27.750
And I'm able to stand in front of you now 
because I was never human!

09:31.300 --> 09:35.640
This is throwing off my plans a bit, 
but well, that's fine.

09:35.640 --> 09:37.890
The result will still be the same.

10:05.870 --> 10:07.220
I did it, Shido!

10:07.220 --> 10:08.850
My attack went through!

10:08.850 --> 10:09.710
Yeah.

10:10.140 --> 10:13.180
Wait, it doesn't look like 
it damaged her at all...

10:13.180 --> 10:14.170
What are you saying?!

10:14.170 --> 10:18.550
Until just now Halvanhelv didn't 
even leave a scratch on her!

10:18.840 --> 10:20.080
I see.

10:20.080 --> 10:23.180
This seems a little troublesome.

10:23.520 --> 10:25.360
My apologies, Tohka.

10:25.360 --> 10:26.950
I'll take you seriously now.

10:27.450 --> 10:31.440
I'll use my full might to steal Shin from you.

10:31.440 --> 10:33.190
I won't let you!

10:33.500 --> 10:35.320
Shido is mine!

10:35.320 --> 10:35.940
Huh?

10:41.910 --> 10:44.410
I see, so this...

10:49.720 --> 10:53.890
I guess you stole a portion of my power 
and the other Spirits' power

10:53.890 --> 10:56.460
when you escaped from within me.

10:56.810 --> 10:59.010
That's how you're able to use such power.

11:04.130 --> 11:05.120
What?!

11:05.120 --> 11:10.310
You are the only Pure Spirit 
in existence aside from myself.

11:10.780 --> 11:13.450
It means you're something like my counterpart.

11:13.890 --> 11:18.190
So perhaps it's only natural that 
you can do the same things I can.

11:18.450 --> 11:19.410
Tohka!

11:19.410 --> 11:20.820
I'll lend you power!

11:50.490 --> 11:54.650
Yes, despair really doesn't suit you.

11:56.120 --> 11:56.770
Tohka!

11:58.370 --> 11:59.400
Sandalphon!

12:01.150 --> 12:02.970
Halvanhelv, huh?

12:03.580 --> 12:05.490
Ein Sof Ohr, Hennet.

12:06.830 --> 12:08.330
Leitribish!

13:04.830 --> 13:06.990
Well done, Tohka.

13:08.090 --> 13:13.490
I'll have to respond to your 
noble feelings and emotions.

13:19.310 --> 13:20.070
Ein.

13:35.930 --> 13:36.990
Tohka?

13:38.060 --> 13:40.210
Tohka is no more.

13:40.910 --> 13:41.710
Huh?

13:42.050 --> 13:43.880
Ein, the Angel of nothingness,

13:43.880 --> 13:48.260
ignores all logic and eliminates everything.

13:49.170 --> 13:50.820
Tohka is no more.

13:51.260 --> 13:53.220
She doesn't exist in this world.

13:55.530 --> 13:58.780
I had no intention of using this Angel,

13:59.230 --> 14:02.460
since it erases the Spirit Power that 
Tohka possessed along with her, but...

14:03.290 --> 14:07.490
I had no choice if I wanted 
to be certain I put her down.

14:08.330 --> 14:13.100
On the other hand, that also means 
Tohka was pressuring me that badly.

14:14.130 --> 14:16.420
So please give Tohka your praise.

14:16.850 --> 14:21.610
Her feelings toward you were enough 
for her to surpass her limits.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.890
Now, Shin,

14:24.510 --> 14:27.510
there truly are no others left to interfere.

14:27.980 --> 14:33.310
The power I have now is plenty 
to give you a body that never dies.

14:33.830 --> 14:38.150
All that's left is restoring to you 
to Shin completely.

14:40.610 --> 14:41.900
Metatron!

14:46.150 --> 14:47.150
Camael!

14:49.210 --> 14:50.530
Zadkiel!

14:56.000 --> 14:56.900
Gabriel!

14:57.290 --> 14:58.330
Raphael!

15:01.790 --> 15:03.020
Haniel!

15:09.090 --> 15:10.340
Michael!

15:14.090 --> 15:15.180
It's no use.

15:19.610 --> 15:20.800
What's this?!

15:20.800 --> 15:22.140
I'm sorry.

15:22.140 --> 15:24.740
It's just difficult 
when you fly around so much.

15:25.110 --> 15:27.230
Now, Shin.

15:34.700 --> 15:35.610
What?

15:40.660 --> 15:43.800
It would seem I've made it in time.

15:43.800 --> 15:47.560
Shido, well done staying alive for me.

15:47.560 --> 15:48.510
Kurumi?!

15:48.900 --> 15:50.760
What's going on?

15:50.760 --> 15:52.850
I thought you were killed by Mio.

15:52.850 --> 15:56.010
My apologies, Shido.

15:56.320 --> 16:00.520
Honestly, I wanted to come 
racing to your side sooner,

16:00.520 --> 16:02.850
but it was quite the first for me,

16:02.850 --> 16:06.150
so I couldn't get the feeling down right.

16:06.150 --> 16:07.300
Huh?

16:07.300 --> 16:09.030
What are you talking about?

16:09.320 --> 16:11.580
Yod Aleph, huh?

16:11.580 --> 16:13.410
You're correct.

16:13.930 --> 16:18.910
It's my eleventh bullet, one that 
sends the target into the future.

16:19.420 --> 16:21.730
I'm a clone of Kurumi Tokisaki

16:21.730 --> 16:28.290
sent into the future from roughly 
an hour ago using Yod Aleph.

16:29.340 --> 16:30.650
Zaphkiel!

16:40.900 --> 16:46.630
Yes, yes, I've been entrusted with this future.

16:48.810 --> 16:55.090
I have been sent here 
to kill you as your final assassin.

16:55.940 --> 16:58.170
Are you being serious?

16:58.170 --> 17:01.240
Do you think a mere clone can defeat me?

17:01.240 --> 17:07.870
I can exist for as long as the Spirit Power 
imbued in Yod Aleph lasts.

17:07.870 --> 17:11.810
That's plenty of time to kill you!

17:18.210 --> 17:20.430
Kurumi! What are you?!

17:20.740 --> 17:23.260
I just told you, did I not?

17:23.260 --> 17:26.260
I came to defeat Mio.

17:26.260 --> 17:28.940
Oh, and one other thing.

17:29.500 --> 17:35.320
I don't think I was able to forget 
how your kiss felt, Shido.

17:37.490 --> 17:38.200
Kurumi!

17:55.260 --> 17:56.510
Kurumi!

17:57.790 --> 17:59.490
What a shame.

17:59.940 --> 18:02.100
I wasn't enough.

18:17.100 --> 18:19.660
Now everything is taken care of.

18:20.190 --> 18:22.490
I applaud all of your feelings.

18:22.930 --> 18:26.410
However, all of your resistance was futile.

18:26.410 --> 18:27.310
Futile?

18:28.660 --> 18:30.170
It wasn't futile.

18:30.450 --> 18:31.950
Thanks to everyone...

18:33.070 --> 18:36.190
and thanks to Tohka fighting for me, 
Kurumi made it in time.

18:36.910 --> 18:41.050
And Kurumi made me realize it.

18:41.590 --> 18:47.360
Origami, Nia, Yoshino, Kotori, Mukuro,

18:47.360 --> 18:53.700
Natsumi, Kaguya, Yuzuru, Miku, and Tohka...

18:54.290 --> 18:57.290
None of their Angels 
were able to work against you.

18:57.970 --> 19:02.320
But I still have the power of one Angel left.

19:02.860 --> 19:06.110
The power of an Angel 
I've never once used before.

19:06.890 --> 19:12.530
Kurumi sent her clone into the future 
to make me realize that!

19:17.130 --> 19:18.490
Zaphkiel!

19:20.300 --> 19:21.260
Vav!

19:48.350 --> 19:49.830
<i>But what do I do?</i>

19:50.590 --> 19:53.020
<i>What can I do to stop Mio's actions?</i>

19:53.450 --> 19:56.690
<i>At this point in time, 
Mio should already be inside of Kurumi.</i>

19:57.320 --> 20:01.690
<i>If I'm not careful, she might 
realize I'm trying to do something.</i>

20:01.690 --> 20:02.690
Shido?

20:05.400 --> 20:07.930
What are you doing out here?

20:08.290 --> 20:09.340
Tohka...

20:10.240 --> 20:10.970
Wha?!

20:10.970 --> 20:12.810
S-Shido?!

20:13.100 --> 20:15.440
Tohka! Tohka!

20:17.950 --> 20:20.100
Yes, it's me.

20:20.100 --> 20:22.570
What's gotten into you, Shido?

20:23.310 --> 20:25.780
Tohka, I...!

20:28.970 --> 20:30.310
I had a dream.

20:31.150 --> 20:32.180
A dream?

20:32.180 --> 20:34.780
Yeah, a bad dream.

20:34.780 --> 20:38.220
One where everyone was defeated 
in the battle against DEM.

20:39.620 --> 20:41.420
I couldn't do anything.

20:42.090 --> 20:44.660
Even though you tried so hard for me, Tohka...

20:45.450 --> 20:46.530
Shido...

20:48.630 --> 20:50.190
It's all right.

20:50.190 --> 20:52.600
I'm sure that won't happen.

20:53.550 --> 20:54.710
Tohka...

20:57.360 --> 21:00.290
Shido, you saved me.

21:00.290 --> 21:01.940
I'm a Spirit,

21:01.940 --> 21:04.750
and instead of calling me your enemy, 
you reached out to me.

21:05.420 --> 21:06.820
So I promise you.

21:06.820 --> 21:09.790
No matter what happens, 
I'll protect you, Shido.

21:10.410 --> 21:15.410
Besides, you're the man who's 
confronted me and the other Spirits.

21:15.410 --> 21:18.500
Like we'd let DEM defeat us now.

21:19.550 --> 21:20.880
I guess that's true.

21:23.010 --> 21:24.630
What's the matter, Shido?

21:25.000 --> 21:26.780
Thank you, Tohka.

21:26.780 --> 21:30.020
Thanks to you, I think I see what I need to do.

21:31.660 --> 21:33.620
I don't really understand,

21:34.050 --> 21:35.620
but that's good then!

21:39.940 --> 21:40.770
Reine.

21:41.590 --> 21:42.390
Hmm?

21:45.340 --> 21:47.570
What is it, Shin?

21:47.980 --> 21:48.900
Reine,

21:49.280 --> 21:52.350
would you go on a date with me tomorrow?

21:52.790 --> 21:55.050
<b>Episode 8</b>

21:52.790 --> 21:55.050
<b>The One Who Pulled the Trigger</b>

23:25.050 --> 23:40.070
Episode 9 "A "Second" Date"

23:25.900 --> 23:28.300
Shido has been granted one final chance.

23:29.050 --> 23:32.180
But how can he conquer Reine and Mio?

23:33.180 --> 23:36.010
Next time is Episode 9: A "Second" Date.

23:37.010 --> 23:39.670
Return to the place in her memories once more.
